eading\">Instructions</div> <ol> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">Blend oatmeal in a blender to a fine powder.</li> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">Combine oatmeal, flour, salt, baking powder and soda and set aside.</li> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">Cream butter and sugars</li> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">Add eggs and vanilla</li> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">Add flour mixture to butter mixture and mix</li> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">Add grated Hershey bar and chocolate chips.</li> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">Bake for 10 minutes at 375.</li> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">Note: Extra batter can be frozen in ice cube trays and then put into freezer bags. When you want fresh cookies, take out a cube and bake for 10 minutes at 375.</li> </ol> <div class=\"ERSClear\"></div> </div> <div class=\"endeasyrecipe\" title=\"style002\" style=\"display: none\">3.5.3226</div> </div><br />\n </p>\n"
